  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born in the toxic runoff of the old Cryo-Labs, 'Whiskey' Bill survived the Freeze-Out simply by being too perpetually plastered to notice. Now, he wanders Subchain City, a walking, talking cocktail of regret and really, really old bourbon. He's pretty sure he used to be somebody important.",
